{"id": 28, "ts": 1780640016.5840552, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "emily_brooks", "message": "I acknowledge the new detail that Candidate\u202fC \u201ckeeps calm in a crisis,\u201d confirming solid stress\u2011resilience, and I also note his ability to make correct decisions quickly and his excellent attention skills. Those traits are valuable for long\u2011distance operations. However, we still have no evidence of his operational reliability (dependability or consistency), and his documented difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric attitude, and reluctance to pursue further education raise serious concerns for crew cooperation and professional communication. Compared with Candidate\u202fB, whose reliability and stress handling are explicitly documented and whose technical competence is strong, the gaps in C\u2019s profile outweigh his strengths. Therefore, I keep my provisional recommendation for Candidate\u202fB, while recognizing that C could become a contender if we could verify his reliability and mitigate his communication issues."}
